Subject: [PATCH 2/4] fix: a window sized with Arbor's own keys belongs where
 it is

A floating window that waits on the laptop while its monitor is away, made larger or smaller there with grow or shrink,
was taken back when the monitor returned, and the size undone. That is its person's command about that window, like
`move-to-display` and like a hand on its edge: no display it floated on fetches it any more.
